<title>USA: Family Bargain July same-store sales fell.</title>
<headline>Family Bargain July same-store sales fell.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Family Bargain Corp Thursday said sales for the four weeks ended Aug 2 fell 1.5 percent from the same period one year ago.</p>
<p>Total sales for the period rose 18.8 percent to $20.7 million from $17.4 million last year.</p>
<p>Same store sales for the 26 weeks ended Aug 2 increased 0.9 percent from the year ago period. Total sales were $129.8 million, an increase of 18.8 percent over sales of $109.2 million one year ago.</p>
</text>
